[{"verse_key":"80:1","translations":[{"text":"他曾皺眉，而且轉身離去，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:2","translations":[{"text":"因為那個盲人來到他的面前。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:3","translations":[{"text":"你怎能知道呢？他也許能受薰陶，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:4","translations":[{"text":"或聽忠告，而蒙教益。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:5","translations":[{"text":"至於自滿者，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:6","translations":[{"text":"你都逢迎他，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:7","translations":[{"text":"他不受薰陶，於你何干？"}]},{"verse_key":"80:8","translations":[{"text":"至於殷切地來請教你，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:9","translations":[{"text":"而且心懷敬畏与神意识者，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:10","translations":[{"text":"你卻怠慢他。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:11","translations":[{"text":"絕不然！這確是一種教訓。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:12","translations":[{"text":"誰欲記誦它，就叫誰記誦它吧。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:13","translations":[{"text":"它在珍貴的冊業裡；"}]},{"verse_key":"80:14","translations":[{"text":"那些冊業，是被稱揚的，是被滌淨的，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:15","translations":[{"text":"是在許多書記的手裡的；"}]},{"verse_key":"80:16","translations":[{"text":"那些書記，是尊貴的，是善良的。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:17","translations":[{"text":"該死的人！他是何等的忘恩！"}]},{"verse_key":"80:18","translations":[{"text":"独一真神曾用什麼創造他的呢？"}]},{"verse_key":"80:19","translations":[{"text":"是用精液。他曾創造他，並預定他發育的程序。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:20","translations":[{"text":"然後，他使他的道路平易。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:21","translations":[{"text":"然後，他使他死，並安葬他。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:22","translations":[{"text":"然後，當他意欲的時候，他使他復活。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:23","translations":[{"text":"絕不然，他還沒有奉行他所命令他的事務。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:24","translations":[{"text":"教人觀察自己的食物吧！"}]},{"verse_key":"80:25","translations":[{"text":"我將雨水大量地傾注下來。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:26","translations":[{"text":"然後，我使地面奇異地裂開，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:27","translations":[{"text":"我在大地上生產百谷，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:28","translations":[{"text":"與葡萄和苜蓿，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:29","translations":[{"text":"與梓橔和海棗，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:30","translations":[{"text":"與茂密的園圃，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:31","translations":[{"text":"水果和牧草，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:32","translations":[{"text":"以供你們和你們的牲畜享受。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:33","translations":[{"text":"當震耳欲聾的轟聲來臨的時候，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:34","translations":[{"text":"在那日，各人將逃避自己的弟兄、"}]},{"verse_key":"80:35","translations":[{"text":"自己的父母、"}]},{"verse_key":"80:36","translations":[{"text":"自己的妻子兒女；"}]},{"verse_key":"80:37","translations":[{"text":"在那日，各人將自顧不暇；"}]},{"verse_key":"80:38","translations":[{"text":"在那日，許多面目是光華的，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:39","translations":[{"text":"是喜笑的，是愉快的；"}]},{"verse_key":"80:40","translations":[{"text":"在那日，許多面目上，將有灰塵，"}]},{"verse_key":"80:41","translations":[{"text":"黧黑將蒙薇它。"}]},{"verse_key":"80:42","translations":[{"text":"這等人，是不信道的，是荒淫的。"}]}]